# ── Build artifacts & backups (never commit) ──
*.zip
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig

# ── OS / editor cruft ──
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~
~$*

# ── Secrets / env ──
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem

# ── Node tooling (if added later) ──
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# NOTE: overlay media (.png .mp4 .mov .webm .gif) is intentionally TRACKED —
# those are live assets served from GitHub Pages. Do not ignore them.
